      "field": "mechanism",
      "original": "Reset, calibration, module replacement and operating probes are distinct modeled activities; physical outcome is followed by operating verification. Recovery policy version 3 records a separate post-mission verification window, retains original deadlines, and escalates unresolved testing; receipt completion never confirms capacity.",
      "release": "Reset, calibration, module replacement and operating probes are distinct modeled activities; physical outcome is followed by operating verification. Recovery policy version 3 records a separate post-mission verification window, retains original deadlines, and escalates unresolved testing; receipt completion never confirms capacity. Version 5 separates each forecast-selected test appointment from its immutable diagnosis/post-mission outer deadline; remaining successful increments are recorded as a necessary-time bound, not a recovery guarantee."
