    {
      "group": "control",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "original": "Greedy, methane MPC and economic MPC operate on declared horizons and information. Service policies use finite candidate sets and subjective recovery/inspection beliefs. Recovery policy version 3 records a separate post-mission verification window, retains original deadlines, and escalates unresolved testing; receipt completion never confirms capacity. Opt-in autonomy version 2 separates finite persistent equipment factors from independent bounded job multipliers, learns only from observed clocks, and preserves per-job phase correlation. Finite-model selection uses a predeclared observation-time holdout; synthetic observation fitting is not field calibration. Conditional retrieval charging can follow a qualified nominated whole-mission return for an already observed stranding; no repair or drive-readiness credit is granted.",
      "release": "Greedy, methane MPC and economic MPC operate on declared horizons and information. Service policies use finite candidate sets and subjective recovery/inspection beliefs. Recovery policy version 3 records a separate post-mission verification window, retains original deadlines, and escalates unresolved testing; receipt completion never confirms capacity. Opt-in autonomy version 2 separates finite persistent equipment factors from independent bounded job multipliers, learns only from observed clocks, and preserves per-job phase correlation. Finite-model selection uses a predeclared observation-time holdout; synthetic observation fitting is not field calibration. Conditional retrieval charging can follow a qualified nominated whole-mission return for an already observed stranding; no repair or drive-readiness credit is granted. Recovery version 5 separates forecast-selected test appointments from immutable outer recovery deadlines and records necessary remaining informative intervals."
    }
  ],
